# Repo-root Docker build context ignores.
#
# Component images in this repository are built with the repository root as the
# build context, because the component Cargo workspaces have path dependencies
# that reach outside their own directory (for example
# storage/reference/storage-service -> storage/reference/storage-core,
# storage/reference/externals/azure-sdk and common/url-normalizer).
#
# Everything the Rust workspaces need to compile must therefore stay in the
# context. In particular do NOT ignore storage/reference/externals/azure-sdk:
# it is a vendored path dependency of storage-service.

# Version control metadata.
.git/
.gitattributes
.gitmodules

# Build outputs.
**/target/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/

# Editor / OS noise.
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store

# Local-only artifacts.
**/*.profraw
**/*.tgz
**/.env
**/_trace/
**/codecov/
**/scratch/
